    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It was a negative image, but odd blotches hung like an aura around the figures, each taken with a new person",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 23838
        },
        {
          "text": "“So you’ve somehow made a film that is sensitive enough to capture it?”",
